
@startuml "
title PayLink - Payment State Diagram

[*] --> Initiated

Initiated --> FundsHeld : Fraud checks pass\nand sufficient balance
Initiated --> Rejected : Fraud check fails\nor insufficient balance

FundsHeld --> SentToBiller : Request sent to biller

SentToBiller --> Completed : Biller confirms
SentToBiller --> Failed : Biller refuses
SentToBiller --> Unknown : Timeout

Unknown --> Completed : Later confirmation\n(callback / retry / settlement)
Unknown --> Failed : Later refusal\nor reconciliation confirms no payment

Failed --> Refunded : Hold released to wallet

Completed --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]

note right of Unknown
  Never refund automatically.
  Wait until biller failure
  is confirmed.
end note

@enduml
